{"product_id":"unrest","title":"Unrest","description":"\u003cp\u003e'Stein's mysterious and melancholy detective has the potential to become the next Alex Cross.'\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e-Real Crime Magazine\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e'It's harsh, dark, yet with a warm, beating heart at its core.'\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e-Lars Kepler, author of The Hypnotist\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\n\u003cp\u003eA man's hooded and tortured body is found in a cemetery in Copenhagen during a riot. With so many police on site, how could anyone be murdered and left out in the open?\u003cbr\u003e\nUnless the killer is one of them?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eDCI Steen is assigned the case, which rapidly becomes more complex and more personal as the body count goes up. He will not stop until the killer is caught, whatever the consequences. But the consequences turn out to be greater than expected - especially for Axel himself.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eReleased for the first time in English, this immensely popular and exciting set of bestselling books kicks off with a dramatic and fast-paced debut.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:32 x 197  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jesper Stein \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781912624041 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 430\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44287729696921,"sku":"16RB39781912624041","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/d1ef063935763f852322e015af8f199a.jpg?v=1715015128","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/unrest","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}